            "schedulingType": "automatic",
            "mode": "customScheduled",
            "dueAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
            "text": "These stairs weren't built for us.\n\nIn Roo, one ancient step can reach a person's waist. People believe the ruins belonged to the Vanir. Getting inside can start with a very human thing: a helping hand.\n\nWho would you bring? Send this to your exploring companion.\n\nThe Land of Roo is an original Nordic fantasy world being created by Thomas Robbjens. Follow the continuing story.\n\nConcept art from The Land of Roo.\n\n#TheLandOfRoo #NordicFantasy #Worldbuilding #FantasyArt",
            "assets": [
              {
                "video": {
                  "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fanderflash/thelandofroo/693211b82d6459da9f9ad393dfdc559060dfe9ba/assets/social/2026-11-04/11-giant-step-reel.mp4",
                  "metadata": {
                    "title": "These stairs weren't built for us"
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "metadata": {
              "instagram": {
                "type": "reel",
                "shouldShareToFeed": true,
                "isAiGenerated": true
