        "facebook": {
          "postId": "6aeafc059e12e98b309be579",
          "status": "sent",
          "dueAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00.000Z",
          "sentAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:17.123Z",
          "request": {
            "channelId": "6aaa9283ea19ca0bde5839d5",
            "schedulingType": "automatic",
            "mode": "customScheduled",
            "dueAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
            "text": "Imagine needing help up a single stair.\n\nAcross Roo, ancient ruins dwarf the people who enter them. A step can rise nearly to a person's waist; Rooans believe these places were built by the Vanir. This imagined moment begins with the practical problem that leaves behind: how do two travelers get inside together?\n\nWho would you trust to take your hand?\n\nThe Land of Roo is an original Nordic fantasy world being created by Thomas Robbjens. Follow the continuing story, from everyday lives to the mysteries of the ancient world.\n\nConcept art from The Land of Roo.\n\n#TheLandOfRoo #NordicFantasy #Worldbuilding #FantasyArt",
            "assets": [
              {
                "video": {
                  "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fanderflash/thelandofroo/693211b82d6459da9f9ad393dfdc559060dfe9ba/assets/social/2026-11-04/11-giant-step-reel.mp4",
                  "metadata": {
