        "facebook": {
          "postId": "6aeafc0e961fae078ac5c319",
          "status": "sent",
          "dueAt": "2026-11-04T16:00:00.000Z",
          "sentAt": "2026-11-04T16:01:47.696Z",
          "request": {
            "channelId": "6aaa9283ea19ca0bde5839d5",
            "schedulingType": "automatic",
            "mode": "customScheduled",
            "dueAt": "2026-11-04T16:00:00Z",
            "text": "Would you give this old cloak another journey?\n\nTwo frames, one small recovery in Roo. The first shows a torn shoulder; the second shows the same cloak made useful again. A visible patch might look imperfect, but it means its owner can keep wearing something familiar when the cold returns.\n\nWhat is one thing you've kept by repairing it?\n\nAn imagined everyday scene. Concept art from The Land of Roo.\n\n#TheLandOfRoo #NordicFantasy #FantasyArt #Worldbuilding",
