            "schedulingType": "automatic",
            "mode": "customScheduled",
            "dueAt": "2026-11-04T19:00:00Z",
            "text": "The smoke means someone stayed.\n\nWould You Survive Roo? — The light on the heath\n\nFor a traveler on this exposed path, a lit window changes everything. There is a fire here. The next ridge can wait.\n\nBut whose welcome is waiting at the door?\n\nFollow for tomorrow's glimpse of life in Roo.\n\nConcept art from The Land of Roo.\n\n#TheLandOfRoo #NordicFantasy #FantasyBooks #FantasyArt",
            "assets": [
              {
                "image": {
                  "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fanderflash/thelandofroo/9eb1f2e84d14382b2eef280b1fbc0afee3ee298d/assets/social/2026-11-04/01-highland-heath.png",
                  "metadata": {
                    "altText": "A lone traveler on a wet highland path passes a small turf-roofed timber cottage, its window lit and chimney smoking beneath storm clouds."
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "metadata": {
              "instagram": {
                "type": "post",
                "shouldShareToFeed": true,
                "isAiGenerated": true
