          "status": "sent",
          "dueAt": "2026-11-04T19:00:00.000Z",
          "sentAt": "2026-11-04T19:02:11.817Z",
          "request": {
            "channelId": "6aaa9283ea19ca0bde5839d5",
            "schedulingType": "automatic",
            "mode": "customScheduled",
            "dueAt": "2026-11-04T19:00:00Z",
            "text": "One lit window changes the whole journey.\n\nWould You Survive Roo? — The light on the heath\n\nImagine reaching this cottage after hours on Roo's open highlands. Smoke rises from the chimney, and a warm window breaks the grey. For the first time in miles, the traveler has somewhere to stop.\n\nThe shelter is real enough to see. The welcome is still unknown. What would you say when someone opened the door?\n\nFollow for tomorrow's glimpse of life in Roo.\n\nConcept art from The Land of Roo.\n\n#TheLandOfRoo #NordicFantasy #FantasyBooks #FantasyArt",
